        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>Two 8.5&nbsp;oz Seatopia <a href=\"/products/king-salmon\" title=\"King Salmon\">King Salmon</a> fillets is exactly one round of this recipe. A teaspoon of ghee is what crisps the skin without smoking, flake salt is the last thing that goes on, and the thermometer is the difference between 122&deg;F and guessing.</p>",
