        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>Two things carry this dish, and both happen while something is still hot: the raisins go into the farro the moment it drains, and the farro gets dressed before it cools.</p>",
        "heading": "The game plan",
        "color_text": "",
