      "name": "Table content",
      "settings": {
        "custom_class": "",
        "padding_top": 24,
        "padding_bottom": 56,
        "divider": false,
        "full_width": false,
        "rounded": false,
        "heading_size": "title-md",
        "heading_alignment": "text-left md:items-end md:flex-row",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>Urfa pepper and sultanas are not in every cupboard, and pearled farro is not in every shop. Almost everything here bends &mdash; what does not bend is dressing the grain while it is warm.</p>",
        "heading": "Swap freely, except the warm part",
